The Doubtfire sisters have 7 kittens from the animal shelter. Their mother says that Patchy, the first cat, has had thrice the number of adopted kittens, which is 3 * 7 = 21 kittens. Trixie, the other cat, has had 12 kittens. So, the total number of kittens the Doubtfire family now has is 7 (from the animal shelter) + 21 (from Patchy) + 12 (from Trixie) = 40 kittens.

Final answer: \boxed{40}
#### 40

Mary has 2 potted plants on each of the 40 window ledges, so she has 2 * 40 = 80 potted plants. She received 18 new potted plants, so she now has 80 + 18 = 98 potted plants. She will give 1 potted plant from each of the 40 window ledges, so she will give away 40 potted plants. Therefore, she will remain with 98 - 40 = 58 potted plants.

Final answer: \boxed{58}
